NOTICE
======

Presets
-------
The presets come from Ryan Geiss's "favorite_presets_2021_01_03"
collection (geisswerks.com/milkdrop/), a compilation of MilkDrop presets by
many authors; the authors are named in the file names. The presets carry no
explicit licence. They are redistributed here, unmodified apart from their
file names, on the presumption that they are in the public domain, as
MilkDrop presets have been freely shared for two decades (the same basis as
projectM's preset packs). Any preset will be removed on request by its
author.

Textures
--------
The textures come from the projectM "presets-milkdrop-texture-pack"
(github.com/projectM-visualizer/presets-milkdrop-texture-pack @
@TEXTURE_COMMIT@), which collects the textures released with MilkDrop and
others used by common presets. That pack states no licence either; the
textures are likewise presumed public domain and will be removed on request.
File names are lowercased; textures larger than @MAX_TEXTURE_PX@ px were downscaled.

These textures are never included: @BANNED_TEXTURES@ (photos of
identifiable people or bands, logos, or images of unknown provenance).
Presets that sample one of them are left out.

Shaders
-------
shaders/*.glsl are machine translations of the presets' own HLSL shader
code (projectM's translator, github.com/bbangert/projectm @
@PROJECTM_COMMIT@); they carry the presets' terms.

Left out of this pack
---------------------
@EXCLUSIONS@

Removal requests
----------------
To have a preset or texture removed, contact: @CONTACT@
